c_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOwo7E4aAv7BrAg4esJh6wdwNTuMB1Gf913EWjThc8c1w&oe=6AD38A8B"}, "display_name": "POLYBLOCS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6KyF6D88ti4Q7kNvwH5oa4t&_nc_oc=AdrGAxf_XParOBf-0eYrnjH3BaLlOA9JkKVmT2z_029AOSAjQ3s8gZkwDY2Cmh4NnMU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNmzXjHyPmAEX1uc75G3c_Lcj1gPqO5YX5oGah6CNV15A&oe=6AD3B649"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wRmHL4rTCN0Q7kNvwGMORe4&_nc_oc=AdohrDLL1TRtqXyZIWg_ilfZPhh5hLv7FToO15NWK_C4AIUVDHvxzl67SU8rxFfkRCM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP4-ddZJnhmfSZkKE54YW4-ZyQL4gm0T-BWpWEJNrJppQ&oe=6AD3B47D"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.577